lyrics:
Voninahitra anie ho an&#39;Andriamanitra

Any amin&#39;ny avo indrindra ;

Fiadanana anie ho an&#39;ny olombelona

Fa nanehoany ny Fitiavany.

Mihoby ny hasinao izahay,

Midera Anao izahay, Mihoby ny hasinao izahay,

Mankalaza Anao izahay, &gt;&gt;

Mitsaoka Anao izahay, &gt;&gt;

Misaotra Anao izahay. &gt;&gt;

Ry Tompo Andriamanitra mpanjakan&#39;ny lanitra

Andriamanitra Ray mahefa ny zavatra rehetra.

Mihoby ny hasinao izahay,

Midera Anao izahay, Mihoby ny hasinao izahay

Mankalaza Anao izahay, &gt;&gt;

Mitsaoka Anao izahay, &gt;&gt;

Misaotra Anao izahay. &gt;&gt;

Ry Jesoa Zanak&#39;Andriamanitra &ocirc;,

Ianao no Zanaka lahitokana ;

Ry Zanak&#39;ondrin&#39;Andriamanitra &ocirc;

Ianao, ry Tompo, no Zanaky ny Ray.

Mamindra fo aminay,

Ry Jesoa Tompo &ocirc;, Mamindra fo aminay

Mpamonjy anay Ianao, &gt;&gt;

Mpanjakanay Ianao, &gt;&gt;

An-kavanan&#39;Izy Ray. &gt;&gt;

Ianao irery no Masina, Ianao irery no Tompo

Ianao irery no Avo indrindra, ry Jesoa Kristy &ocirc;.

Ao amin&#39;ny Fanahy Masina,

Ho Anao, ry Ray &ocirc;, Ao amin&#39;ny Fanahy Masina

Ho Anao, ry Tompo &ocirc;, &gt;&gt;

Ny voninahitra e, &gt;&gt;

Mandrakizay, Amen. &gt;&gt;

1. Ianao no hazavana, Jesoa Kristy zokinay

Ianao no arahinay amin’ny fiainanay

Fiv : Hoy ny antsonay sy baikonay vahoaka notiavinao

Hohamasinina anie ny anaranao, ho tonga anie ny fanjakanao

2. Ianao no fahendrena&hellip;

3. Ianao no Famonjena&hellip;

4. Ianao no Mpankahery&hellip;

5. Ianao Mpitari-dalana&hellip;

6. Ianao Mpanolo-tsaina&hellip;

Ho enin-kasina ianareo e,

Ho enin-kavelomana!

Kristy arahinareo e:

Kristy nitsangan-ko velona (indroa)

1- Kristy no Lalana, Kristy no Marina

Kristy no Aina, Kristy no Masina.

2- Nirahin’ny Ray tety an-tany ianao e, Kristy &ocirc;

Nijaly sy maty hamonjy anay ianao e, Kristy &ocirc;

Nitsangan-ko velona am-boninahitra ianao e, Kristy &ocirc;

Eo an-kavanan’Andriamanitra ianao e, Kristy &ocirc;

3- Ny fijaliana, ny fahafatesana

Ho resinay, herezinao

4- Fa nanome ny Fanahy Masina ianao e, Kristy &ocirc;

Eto am-povoan’ny mpianatra ianao e, Kristy &ocirc;

Mamelombelona ny Fiangonana ianao e, Kristy &ocirc;

Mbola ho avy hiantso anay ianao e, Kristy &ocirc;

5- Ka voninahitra ho anao, ry Ray &ocirc;,

Ho an’ny Zanaka sy ny Fanahy.

1 - 2 Ry zanak’ondrin’andriamanitra &ocirc;

 Zay manala ny fahotan’izao tontolo izao

 Mamindra fo aminay e (in-2)



3 Ry zanak’ondrin’Andriamanitra &ocirc;

 Zay manala ny fahotan’izao tontolo izao

 Omeo fiadanana izahay e (in-2)

Maria Reny mpampihavana &ocirc;;

Tsofy rano ireto zanakao;

Ampihavano amin’Izy Ray e

Ampihavano amin’ny olombelona;

Midera anao zahay (2)

1 - Ny lanitra mavana, irony havoana

Toa antsonao e Maria &ocirc;

Tongava hihavana, homeko haravoana

Izay te-ho sambatra e avia (2)

2 - Ny Ray, ny Zanaka, Fanahy Masina

Andriamanitra iray e;

Alao tahaka ho anin-kasina,

Ho velona mandrakizay e (2)

3 - Miandrandra ny lanitra ny zanakao e,

Miverina amin’ny Ray;

Kristy Andriamanitra ilazalazao

Fa tena zandriny izahay (2)

4 - Fifankatiavana no baikonay,

Jereo, ry Reny malala &ocirc;;

Mifandray tanana toa olona iray,

Mpirahalahy mianala (2)

5 - Tsy fantatrao ve ny Reninao &ocirc;

Mamelombelona hatrany e;

Fitiavan-dehibe an-tokantrano

No paradisa eto an-tany (2)

1 Rainay ao an-danitra ao, hohamasinina anie ianao:

 Hotiavina sy hajaina e,     hohamasinina e ny anaranao,

 Ianao no Ray &ocirc;,                         &gt;&gt;                    &gt;&gt;

 Ianao no Tompo,                       &gt;&gt;                    &gt;&gt;

 Ianao no Masina e,                    &gt;&gt;                    &gt;&gt;

 Ry Avo indrindra &ocirc;,                   &gt;&gt;                    &gt;&gt;

 Zanaharinay &ocirc;,                         &gt;&gt;                    &gt;&gt;

 Et&yacute; an-tany e,                          &gt;&gt;                    &gt;&gt;

                                         ho tahaka ny ao an-danitra!



2 Rainay ao an-danitra ao, fitiavana anie ianao:

 Deraina, ampanjakana e, hampanjakaina e ny fitiavanao,

 Amin&#39;ny tokantranao &ocirc;,              &gt;&gt;                   &gt;&gt;

 Amin&#39;ny havan-tiana,                 &gt;&gt;                   &gt;&gt;

 Amin&#39;ny fahavalo,                      &gt;&gt;                   &gt;&gt;

 Amin&#39;ireo madinika e,                &gt;&gt;                   &gt;&gt;

 Amim-piaraha-monina e,           &gt;&gt;                   &gt;&gt;

 Et&yacute; an-tany e,                           &gt;&gt;                   &gt;&gt;

                                         ho tahaka ny ao an-danitra!



3 Rainay ao an-danitra ao, izao no sitrakao:

 Ny hinoana an&#39;i Jesoa e, hotanterahina e ny sitrakao,

 Harahinay e,                              &gt;&gt;                  &gt;&gt;

 Hiainanay e,                              &gt;&gt;                  &gt;&gt;

 Hambaranay e,                          &gt;&gt;                  &gt;&gt;

 Ho iray ihany e,                         &gt;&gt;                  &gt;&gt;

 Ny zanakao e,                            &gt;&gt;                  &gt;&gt;

 Et&yacute; an-tany e,                            &gt;&gt;                  &gt;&gt;

                                         ho tahaka ny ao an-danitra!



4 Rainay ao an-danitra ao, misaotra anao &#39;zahay:

 Tah&iacute;nao isan&#39;andro,          misaotra anao e ny zanakao,

 Velominao e,                              &gt;&gt;                 &gt;&gt;

 Avela heloka e,                          &gt;&gt;                 &gt;&gt;

 Mba hifamela,                            &gt;&gt;                 &gt;&gt;

 Arovanao e,                               &gt;&gt;                 &gt;&gt;

 Ka velona aina,                          &gt;&gt;                 &gt;&gt;

 Et&yacute; an-tany e,                            &gt;&gt;                 &gt;&gt;

                                         ho tahaka ny ao an-danitra!

(Ezek. 36, 25-28)

Hofafazako rano ianareo,             avia, ry Fanahy Masina &ocirc;

Dia hadio ny fahotanareo,            avia, ry Fanahy Masina &ocirc;

Homeko fo vaovao ianareo,          avia, ry Fanahy Masina &ocirc;

Fanahy vaovao no omeko anareo, avia, ry Fanahy Masina &ocirc;

Fa ankehitriny, ankehitriny izao,

Hanavao ny tarehin&#39;ny tany aho;

Fa ankehitriny, ankehitriny izao,

Fanahy vaovao no omeko anareo.

Hoesoriko amin&#39;ny fonareo ny fo vato, avia, ry Fanahy Masina &ocirc;

Dia homeko fo nofo ianareo,               avia, ry Fanahy Masina &ocirc;

Hataoko ao anatinareo ny Fanahiko,    avia, ry Fanahy Masina &ocirc;

Dia hanaraka ny fitsipiko ianareo,       avia, ry Fanahy Masina &ocirc;

Fanahy vaovao no omeko anareo,  avia, ry Fanahy Masina &ocirc;

Dia hitandrina ny didiko ianareo,   avia, ry Fanahy Masina &ocirc;

Amin&#39;izay, ho vahoakako ianareo,  avia, ry Fanahy Masina &ocirc;

Ary izaho ho Andriamanitrareo,     avia, ry Fanahy Masina &ocirc;

Tiava e e marina tokoa e e e,

dia ataovy izay tianao hatao.

1. Ny fitiavana mahay mifamela &eth; &eth; &eth;

Ny fitiavana mahay mifandefitra

2. Ny fitiavana mahay mifampizara &eth; &eth; &eth;

Ny fitiavana mifanohana.

Tompo &ocirc;, &#39;zany hafaliako zanakao natsanganao e;

I Kristy no ato amiko: velona aho fa velona izy.



1 I Kristy no masoandro be, hazavana avy aminao, ry Ray;

 Izahay no toy ny tarany manazava izao tontolo izao.



2 Faniriana ny ho velona, vetsovetso ny ho sambatra;

 I Kristy no tena aina, hasambarana mandrakizay.



3 Fikasana ny hihavana, mba ho tia sy hotiavina;

 I Kristy no be fitiavana, izy monina ato am-ponay.



4 Tia anao &#39;zahay fa zanakao, Rainay tsy mbola hitanay;

 I Kristy eto afovoanay no mitaona anay ho aminao.

(Sal. 110)

Midera anao sy misaotra anao e

&#39;Zahay, Andriamanitra &ocirc;,

Satria ianao no namonjy anay

Ka nahazoanay ny fiainana.



1 Ny ato anatiko, ry Tompo &ocirc;

 Hidera anao tokoa, ry Tompo &ocirc;

 Hihira ny asanao, ry Tompo &ocirc;

 Ny andro iainako, ry Tompo &ocirc;



2 Ny asanao, ry Iaveh, ry Tompo &ocirc;

 Fiamboniana, ry Tompo &ocirc;

 Mandrakizay, endrey, ry Tompo &ocirc;

 Ny fahamarinanao, ry Tompo &ocirc;



3 Ny fahatsiarovana, ry Tompo &ocirc;

 Ny asa vitanao, ry Tompo &ocirc;

 Dia mipetraka, ry Tompo &ocirc;

 Be indrafo ianao, ry Tompo &ocirc;



4 Nomenao hanina, ry Tompo &ocirc;

 &#39;Reo &#39;zay matahotra, ry Tompo &ocirc;

 Tsy mba mivadika, ry Tompo &ocirc;

 Mandrakizay ianao,ry Tompo &ocirc;



5 Nahariharinao, ry Tompo &ocirc;

 Ny herin-tsandrinao, ry Tompo &ocirc;

 Ho lovam-pirenena, ry Tompo &ocirc;

 Hatolotrao anay, ry Tompo &ocirc;



6 Ny asan-tananao, ry Tompo &ocirc;

 Dia rariny tokoa, ry Tompo &ocirc;

 Tsy mety miova re, ry Tompo &ocirc;

 Ny didy nomenao, ry Tompo &ocirc;



7 Mitondra famonjena, ry Tompo &ocirc;

 Ho an&#39;ny vahoaka ianao, ry Tompo &ocirc;

 Nanao fifanekena, ry Tompo &ocirc;

 Mandrakizay ianao, ry Tompo &ocirc;



8 Ny anaranao, ry Iaveh, ry Tompo &ocirc;

 Dia mahatahotra, ry Tompo &ocirc;

 Ny tahotra an&#39;i Iaveh, ry Tompo &ocirc;

 No loham-pahendrena, ry Tompo &ocirc;.

Masimbavy Terezy, raisinay ny baikonao:

&quot;Andriamanitra irery, ampy anay Andriamanitra&quot;.



1 Ny haravoana sy ny dera voninkazo ho maina anie;

 Ny Tompo kosa loharano tsy ho ritra mandrakizay.



2 Ireo harena sy ny vola taratasy hanidina;

 Ny Tompo kosa tena lova miavosa mandrakizay.



3 Hatanorana rehareha toa maraina miserana;

 Ny Tompo kosa soa indrindra no anjara mandrakizay.



4 Ny sentosento fijaliana mbola hisava fa rahona;

 Ny Tompontsika masoandro mibaliaka mandrakizay.



5 Mitebiteby mitaraina ny tsy manana hiankinana;

 Ny Tompontsika vatolampy, tokin&#39;aina mandrakizay.



6 Ny fahoriana sy tomany haizimpito hisinda anie;

 Ny Tompontsika hazavana, paradisa mandrakizay.

1 - Dony ny hira fanajana

Sy fiderana Zanahary ;

Ry manana aina, miankohofa eo anatrehan&#39;i Jesoa. (3)

2 - Izay miery ao anatin&#39;

Ny endri-mofo sy divay ;

Izy tokoa no Zanahary nanao sy nanavotra antsika. (3)

3 - Ry Tompo mamin&#39;ny fonay e,

Velomy ao anatinay

Finoana mafy sy fitiavana hoentinay mandray Anao. (3)

Andriamanitra Babanay e

Mankasitra anao &#39;zahay

Nagnandefa Jesoa Zanakao &ocirc;

Nagniraka ny Fagnahy

Nitsanganan-dRasoamanarivo &ocirc;

Ho voninahitrao.



1 Anao nagniraka Jesoa Zanakao &ocirc;

 Namangy ny tanin&#39;ny Malagasy e

 Mba hitory Vaovao Mahafaly e

 Nampitsangana an-dRasoamanarivo &ocirc;

 Izy nino sy nandray ny teninao &ocirc;

 Tsy nanaiky ho resin&#39;ny fahavalo

 Mba ho vavolombelon&#39;ny Finoana a

 Tsy voavily hiala amin&#39;izay nekena.



2 Jesoa nitory Vaovao Mahafaly

 Namafy hitsimoka am-pon&#39;ny Malagasy

 Ny Fitiavana ambonin&#39;ny zaka jiaby e

 Nitsanganan-dRasoamanarivo &ocirc;

 Notandremany sady nampanjakainy e

 Nianany mba hanambara ny hafatrao &ocirc;

 Notoriny ny fara-Fitiavanao &ocirc;

 Fitaovana nentiny handresy fankahalana.



3 Notanterahin&#39;i Jesoa ny Famonjena

 Fanantenan&#39;ireo olom-boafidinao &ocirc;

 Ry Victoire Rasoamanarivo

 Tsy mba nety ho resin&#39;ny hakiviana

 Nanantena sy nandray ny famonjena

 Vokatr&#39;ilay voantsinapy nafafinao &ocirc;

 Nanagnan-tagnagna magneragna ny Nosy e

 Ny fanantenan-dRasoamanarivo &ocirc;.

1 Asandrato i Maria, tolory voninahitra izy;

 Asandrato i Maria, an-tany sy any an-danitra any.

 Aoka ny fontsika hankasitraka azy;

 Aoka ny fontsika hiray fiderana;

 Ka ny vava rehetra hiray hankalaza an&#39;i Maria.



Asandrato i Maria

Tolory voninahitra izy;

Asandrato i Maria,

An-tany sy any an-danitra any.



2 Ny hatsaran&#39;i Maria hajao sy ankalazaontsika;

 Ny hatsaran&#39;i Maria soraty hiraikitra am-pontsika.

 Tany aman-danitra, mankamas&igrave;na azy,

 Tany aman-danitra, mba mankalaza.

 &#39;Sika va tsy mba hihira ny Andriambavintsika?



3 Tanteraho, ry Maria, ny fitahianao anay e;

 Tanteraho, ry Maria, ny hasambaran&#39;ny fonay;

 Mba tariho lalana &#39;zahay sao ho diso;

 Mba tariho lalana &#39;zahay zanakao;

 Ka hadio fo &#39;zahay e mandra-pahafatinay.

Derao ny anarana

Hirao ny voninahitry

Ny fandresena ben&#39;

Ny Mpamonjy antsika.

Nandresy i Jesoa

Ka resy i Satana;

Hirao ny voninahitr&#39;

I Jesoa sy i Maria e.



1 Ry Maria Reninay, i Jesoa Zanakao

 Tsy mba mety ho lo toy ny olon-drehetra:

 Ilay nanao ny aina tsy ela tao am-pasana,

 Ka inona moa no tsy hainy hatao?



2 Hita marina izao izay teny rehetra

 Nolazain&#39;i Jesoa, milaza azy hitsangana;

 Avelao ny fontsika hifaly hahita azy;

 Tafatsangan-ko velona indray.

Tsy hoe tsy fitia no nanainga anay

Hamoy ireo tiana sy ny hafaliana an-tany

Tsarovy fa misy ny avo noho ireo

Dia ilay zato heny, et&yacute; sy any am-paradisa.



1 Tozoy hatrany ny lalanao fa ho zary hafaliana &ocirc; &ocirc; &ocirc;

 Lanjao ny fijaliana! iareto am-pifaliana

 Fa hanosika hatrany ny vavaka atao!

    Tsy tsapan&#39;ireo mihevitra fa adala &ocirc;

    &#39;Reo manantena ny hasambarana!

    Tsy tsapan&#39;ireo mihevitra fa adala &ocirc;

    Fa hahasoa azy no nahatonga izany.



2 Fo feno hafaliana, fiadanana hatrany,

 Ny haizina aza hazava &ocirc; &ocirc; &ocirc;

 Hanjary lohataona ny andro ririnina

 Sikino hatrany ny fanantenana!

    Tsy tsapan&#39;ireo mihevitra fa adala &ocirc;

    &#39;Reo manantena ny hasambarana!

    Tsy tsapan&#39;ireo mihevitra fa adala &ocirc;

    Fa hahasoa azy no nahatonga izany.

Izany no Vaovao mahafaly



1 Izany no Vaovao mahafaly,          Nahita ny Tompo aho

2 Nitsangan-ko velona marina izy,                &gt;&gt;

3 Nasandratra anilan&#39;ilay Rainy,                   &gt;&gt;

4 Ilay Rainy nanjary iombonantsika              &gt;&gt;



5 Izany no Vaovao mahafaly,          Matoky ny Tompo isika

6 Fa tombon-dalana ny azy Tompo:               &gt;&gt;

7 Ny lala-nodiaviny hodiavintsika,                 &gt;&gt;

8 Ny Tompo hiverina haka antsika,                &gt;&gt;

Tsisy afa-tsy raha araiky e

No angatahiko aminar&ocirc; &ocirc;,

Dia ny mba hifankatiavanar&ocirc; &ocirc;

Karaha ny nitiavako anar&ocirc; &ocirc;!

Mitiava mari&ntilde;y, (indroa)

Ataovy izay tianao hatao;

Fitiavana e e ia, mitiava mari&ntilde;y:

Mahay mifampizara, mahay mandanjalanja,

Tsy manam-pahataperana, misy fandeferana;

Fitiavana e e ia, mitiava mari&ntilde;y. (indroa)

Jesoa Tompo Zokinay, loharanon-karavoana,

Haninay sy herinay: tena mana vaovao.

Hafaliana sady toky, Andriamanitra tokoa,

Jesoa Tompo Zokinay: loharanon-karavoana.



1 Velona aina sy navitrika &#39;re Razana fahiny

 Nofahananao Nahary &#39;lay sakafo mahagaga:

 Vatsy tokana sy antoka f&#39;ianao no hafaliany;

 Jesoa Tompo Zokinay, loharanon-karavoana.



2 Velombolo nientanentana nandre anao, ry Jesoa,

 &#39;Reo vahoaka arivoarivo nizarana mofo dimy;

 Tokam-po, iray fanahy, faly hampanjaka anao:

 Jesoa Tompo Zokinay, loharanon-karavoana.



3 Rah&#39;namaky mofo ianao &#39;reto mpianatra dia nino:

 Fizarana, fahafoizana, no aina ho anay;

 Mba ho faly koa izahay hanasoa ny namanay;

 Jesoa Tompo Zokinay, loharanon-karavoana.



4 &#39;Zany Ra sy Vatanao no amahananao vahoaka,

 Ny Fanahinao mahery anosoranao Mpanjaka;

 Miombona aina &#39;zao &#39;zahay satria re tokana ny Ray;

 Jesoa Tompo Zokinay, loharanon-karavoana.

1 Mpanjakavavin&#39;ny lanitra, mivavaha ho anay;

 Renin&#39;ny Tompo Andriamanitra, mivavaha ho anay;

 Ry Reninay tanora, mivavaha ho anay;

2 Virjiny be voninahitra, mivavaha ho anay;

 Nampiakarina an-danitra, mivavaha ho anay;

 Ry Reninay tanora, mivavaha ho anay;

3 Reny be hasoavana... Reny tsy azon&#39;ny ota...

4 Vonjy ho anay kristianina... Mpanjakan&#39;ny Ap&ocirc;st&ocirc;ly...

5 Kintana mpitari-dalana... ry Reny mpanoro hevitra...

6 Virjiny be fahendrena... Ankizivavin&#39;ny Tompo...

7 Amin&#39;ny andro hahafatesanay... Reny mpamoha ny lanitra...

Ny hatsaran-tarehin&#39;

Ny Tompo Andriamanitra

Avy amin&#39;i Si&ocirc;na.

(Sal. 79)



1 Ry Mpiandry an&#39;i Israely, henoy ny vavakay;

 Ny herinao fohazy, avia hamonjy anay.



2 Rahoviana re, ry Tompo, no hiala aminay

 Ny hatezeranao, ry Tompo, ry Iaveh?



3 Fa mofon-dranomaso no mofo haninay;

 Amindrao fo &#39;zahay, &#39;zahay vahoakanao.



4 Ry Andriamanitray &ocirc;, antsoy re &#39;zahay;

 Ny tavanao endre hihiratra aminay.



5 Nofoananao daholo ny voly an-taninay;

 Ireo olon-kafa nasolonao anay.



6 Ry Andriamanitray &ocirc;, avia, miverena;

 Tsimbino sy tsinjovy ity vahoakanao.



7 Fa tsy handao anao intsony re &#39;zahay,

 Satria velominao &#39;zahay fa miantso anao.



8 Ny laza sy ny dera, ho anao mandrakizay

 Andriamanitray, ao amn&#39;ny Trinite.

1 Tao anaty rivo-doza naharipaka ny hazo;

 Tao anaty feo mitrena nampihorohoro tany;

 Tao anay lelan&#39;afo nahakila ny tanana;

 Tsia, tsy tao ianao!

2 Am&#39;ireny lahateny tsara rindra sy malaza;

 Am&#39;ireny ady am-basy mahapotika ny osa;

 Amin&#39;ireny rentirentim-boninahitr&#39;olombelona;

 Tsia, tsy tao ianao!

3 Amy toerana mangina ivavahan&#39;ny mahantra;

 Amin&#39;ny andro mampilofika ny olo-mino anao;

 Amy faharetam-pon&#39;izay miandry anao hatrany;

 Eny, Tompo, eo ianao!

Ambonin&#39;ny zaka jiaby ny fitiavana;

Ny fitiavana no mitondra

Ny hatsaram-panahy jiaby. Aleloia!

E e e eia, mandrosoa hasina;

Mandrosoa hasina e, hitondra ny hatsarana.

Aleloia, Hozana, Amen!

1 Didy soan-Jagnahary ny fitiavana;

 Zagnahary no mitsinjo, tia antsika voalohany.

E e e e ia, mandrosoa hasi&ntilde;a, mandrosoa hasi&ntilde;a e,

Mitondra ny hatsarana, Aleloia !

2 Hasina, vonjy amin-Jagnahary ny fitiavana;

 Izay tia mahafoy ny ainy ho an&#39;ny namana.

Ambonin&#39;ny zaka jiaby ny fitiavana;

Ny fitiavana no mitondra

Ny hatsaram-panahy jiaby. Aleloia!

3 Joro tsara amin-Jagnahary ny fitiavana;

 Manoro antsika ny lalana marina ny fitiavana.

E e e e ia, mandrosoa hasi&ntilde;a, mandrosoa hasi&ntilde;a e,

Mitondra ny hatsarana, Aleloia !

4 Maniraka antsika hifanampy ny fitiavana;

 Mitondra antsika hifandefitra ny fitiavana.

Ambonin&#39;ny zaka jiaby ny fitiavana;

Ny fitiavana no mitondra

Ny hatsaram-panahy jiaby. Aleloia!

5 Hafaliana sy haravoana ny fitiavana;

 Manala antsika amin&#39;ny habadoana ny fitiavana.

E e e e, mandrosoa hasi&ntilde;a, mandrosoa hasi&ntilde;a e,

Mitondra ny hatsarana, Aleloia !

6 Hasambarana, fiadanana ny fitiavana;

 Mampah&#39;tonga antsika amy voninahitra ny fitiavana.

Ambonin&#39;ny zaka jiaby ny fitiavana;

Ny fitiavana no mitondra

Ny hatsaram-panahy jiaby. Aleloia!

Fa mandrakizay e ny hatsaram-pon'ny Tompo;
     (Fa lalina loatra e)
Fa lalina loatra e ny fitiavany antsika;
     (Vonjeo izahay)
Vonjeo izaha e ry Mpamonjy anay.
     (Ianao no nanafaka)
Ianao no nanafaka anay tamy ratsy;
     (Nijaly sy maty)
Nijaly sy maty e teo ambony hazo;
     (Kanefa nitsangana)
Kanefa nitsangana nandresy ny fasana.
